{
  "id": "E312",
  "title": "“Monthly Use Up Clan”",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-03-31",
  "synopsis": "Here is a useful term for people who spend every penny they own each month.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1006/aa45cffc6095497ccd37e032765f096b9b792087.mp3?1553506179",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "月光族\n\n小乐：下个星期我们一起去南京玩吧！\n保罗：我很想去，但是我没有钱了。\n小乐：什么？这个月才刚开始啊。你真是个月光族。\n保罗：什么是月光族？\n小乐：“月光族”是说每个月都会把自己的钱花光的人。\n保罗：那我还真是一个“月光族”啊！",
    "traditional": "月光族\n\n小樂：下個星期我們一起去南京玩吧！\n保羅：我很想去，但是我沒有錢了。\n小樂：什麼？這個月才剛開始啊。你真是個月光族。\n保羅：什麼是月光族？\n小樂：“月光族”是說每個月都會把自己的錢花光的人。\n保羅：那我還真是一個“月光族”啊！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Monthly Use Up Clan"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：下个星期我们一起去南京玩吧！",
      "traditional": "小樂：下個星期我們一起去南京玩吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè xià ge xīng qī wǒ men yì qǐ qù nán jīng wán ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Let’s go to Nanjing together next week!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：我很想去，但是我没有钱了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我很想去，但是我沒有錢了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ hěn xiǎng qù dàn shì wǒ méi yǒu qián le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I really want to go, but I’m out of money."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：什么？这个月才刚开始啊。你真是个月光族。",
      "traditional": "小樂：什麼？這個月才剛開始啊。你真是個月光族。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shén me zhè ge yuè cái gāng kāi shǐ a nǐ zhēn shì ge yuè guāng zú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: What? This month has just begun. You really belong to the “monthly use up clan”."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：什么是月光族？",
      "traditional": "保羅：什麼是月光族？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shén me shì yuè guāng zú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What is the “monthly use up clan”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：“月光族”是说每个月都会把自己的钱花光的人。",
      "traditional": "小樂：“月光族”是說每個月都會把自己的錢花光的人。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yuè guāng zú shì shuō měi ge yuè dōu huì bǎ zì jǐ de qián huā guāng de rén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: “Monthly use up clan” refers to people who use up all their money every month."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：那我还真是一个“月光族”啊！",
      "traditional": "保羅：那我還真是一個“月光族”啊！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà wǒ hái zhēn shì yí ge yuè guāng zú a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then I really am part of the “monthly use up clan”!"
    }
  ],
